    "text": "\\begin{equation}\n  \\label{eq:pgm-static-directed-naive}\n  p(y,\\bm{x})=\\pi_y\\prod_{i=1}^{d}p(x_i\\mid y),\\qquad\n  p(y\\mid\\bm{x})=\n  \\frac{\\pi_y\\prod_i p(x_i\\mid y)}\n       {\\sum_{k=1}^{K}\\pi_k\\prod_i p(x_i\\mid k)}.\n\\end{equation}"
