    "line": 31,
    "end_line": 41,
    "text": "\\begin{equation}\n  \\label{eq:pgm-static-directed-naive-boundary}\n  \\begin{aligned}\n  \\log\\frac{p(Y=1\\mid\\bm{x})}{p(Y=0\\mid\\bm{x})}\n    &=b+\\sum_{i=1}^{d}w_i x_i,\\\\\n  b&=\\log\\frac{\\pi_1}{\\pi_0}\n       +\\sum_i\\log\\frac{1-a_{i,1}}{1-a_{i,0}},\\\\\n  w_i&=\\log\\frac{a_{i,1}(1-a_{i,0})}\n                       {a_{i,0}(1-a_{i,1})}.\n  \\end{aligned}\n\\end{equation}"
